<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">

    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">

    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.8/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.7.2/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">

    <title><%= title %></title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/style.css" />
    
  </head>

  <body>
    
    <%- include('partials/header') %>

    <main class="container mt-5 mb-5">

    <div class="row justify-content-center">
      <div class="col-lg-9">

      <h1 class="text-center mb-4">My Projects</h1>

      <article>
        <h3>Network Design and Configuration</h3>

        <p>
          In my networking course, I worked on designing
          and configuring networks using Cisco Packet Tracer.
          This involved planning IP addresses, connecting
          devices, and testing communication between
          different networks.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="mt-4">
        <h3>Investra</h3>

        <p>
          Investra is a personal finance tracking website
          that I've been working on outside of school.
          It helps users keep track of their investments,
          view their holdings, and see transactions
          from different accounts in one place.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="mt-4">
        <h3>Scorio</h3>

        <p>
          Scorio is another website project I've worked on.
          I made it to help students keep track of their
          assignments and deadlines. The idea was to make
          it easier to see upcoming schoolwork and
          stay organized throughout the semester.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="mt-4">
        <h3>Canada Online Tutoring Website Review</h3>

        <p>
          I worked on reviewing the Canada Online Tutoring
          website and finding ways to improve its SEO.
          I researched keywords, looked at different
          pages on the website, and suggested changes
          to improve the content and page structure.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="mt-4">
        <h3>2naturelle Website Optimization</h3>

        <p>
          I worked on improving the website content
          and SEO for 2naturelle, an online skincare
          business. I made changes to Shopify search
          listings, researched keywords, and wrote
          blog content about skincare.
        </p>
      </article>

      </div>
    </div>

    </main>
    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
  </body>
  
</html>
